1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:01:25,347 --> 00:01:27,390
Young Master Yamato!

20
00:01:27,391 --> 00:01:28,956
Where are you going?!

21
00:01:36,217 --> 00:01:39,304
The armory lies at the deepest level
of the underground!

22
00:01:39,957 --> 00:01:41,696
Can I reach it in time?

23
00:01:42,304 --> 00:01:43,651
Momonosuke-kun!

24
00:01:44,304 --> 00:01:48,130
You must slow the island's advance,
even if only slightly!

25
00:01:48,130 --> 00:01:50,130
Momonosuke-kun!

26
00:01:55,347 --> 00:01:57,782
'Tis trying, but I shall persevere!

27
00:01:57,782 --> 00:02:01,999
Show your guts!
Momonosuke, you can do this!

28
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,043
You can still do more!

29
00:02:04,043 --> 00:02:08,086
You must create more
Flame Clouds...

30
00:02:08,086 --> 00:02:12,651
Stronger Flame Clouds,
mighty enough to rival Kaido's!

31
00:02:14,869 --> 00:02:16,608
More and more!

32
00:02:16,608 --> 00:02:20,825
I shall not allow Onigashima
to reach the Flower Capital!

33
00:02:23,957 --> 00:02:29,304
Trafalgar...
Your ability's awakened, hasn't it?

34
00:02:33,435 --> 00:02:35,174
I'm not used to it yet...

35
00:02:35,869 --> 00:02:40,130
I'd use it if it meant the difference between life and death,
but it drains the hell outta my stamina...

36
00:02:40,217 --> 00:02:43,304
It could end up being
a critical misstep in a fight.

37
00:02:47,130 --> 00:02:48,652
Same here.

38
00:02:50,565 --> 00:02:53,304
But we ain't getting
anywhere like this!

39
00:02:56,608 --> 00:02:59,825
Better be ready to back me up
with your ace in the hole!

40
00:03:09,782 --> 00:03:13,391
I know, Kaido!

41
00:03:13,391 --> 00:03:16,956
About the great armory
at the lowest level of the castle!

42
00:03:16,957 --> 00:03:19,348
I know what's there!

43
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:24,782
The weapons I ordered made,
along with a massive stockpile of ammunition!

44
00:03:24,782 --> 00:03:28,347
There's going to be a
huge, huge, huge explosion!

45
00:03:28,347 --> 00:03:32,260
Set it alight, Kanjuro!

46
00:03:32,260 --> 00:03:35,651
Blow everything to smithereens!

47
00:03:35,696 --> 00:03:39,913
To the abyss, to the abyss...

48
00:03:39,913 --> 00:03:46,565
And we shall host the greatest finale
at the Kurozumi Clan's graveyard!

49
00:03:50,957 --> 00:03:54,565
It is over!
It all ends here!

50
00:03:54,565 --> 00:03:57,347
I tire of dealing with utter fools!

51
00:03:57,347 --> 00:04:00,564
Come to me at once, Fukurokuju!

52
00:04:00,565 --> 00:04:02,608
Flower Shuriken!

53
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:04,347
Mere trifle!

54
00:04:04,347 --> 00:04:06,390
Earlobe Crackers!

55
00:04:10,739 --> 00:04:13,043
I shall lay waste to our lord's enemies!

56
00:04:13,043 --> 00:04:13,652
Nin!

57
00:04:13,739 --> 00:04:16,652
Ninja think of nothing
but their duty!

58
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,826
Let us escape from here!
Escape, I say!

59
00:04:25,826 --> 00:04:29,956
Before Onigashima is
engulfed in flames and explodes!

60
00:04:29,957 --> 00:04:36,782
A war between pirates
is none of our business!

61
00:04:36,782 --> 00:04:43,217
Naughty brats like you
need to be taught a harsh lesson!

62
00:04:43,217 --> 00:04:45,087
Sovereignty!

63
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:20,347
I got one of you, didn't I...

64
00:05:21,086 --> 00:05:22,999
Kid!

65
00:05:24,826 --> 00:05:28,826
Those two are keeping Big Mom at bay?

66
00:05:29,391 --> 00:05:31,782
How incredible!

67
00:05:41,391 --> 00:05:43,217
I'll have your head!

68
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:51,478
Better be ready to back me up
with your ace in the hole!

69
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,913
K-Room:

70
00:05:59,086 --> 00:06:00,999
Anesthesia!

71
00:06:01,913 --> 00:06:05,826
I'm gonna make this
real painful for you!

72
00:06:05,826 --> 00:06:10,304
And I'm gonna give ya
the worst pain of your life!

73
00:06:22,739 --> 00:06:25,000
The penetration itself is harmless...

74
00:06:25,957 --> 00:06:28,304
But K-Room...

75
00:06:28,739 --> 00:06:31,043
...generates an internal shockwave!

76
00:06:31,782 --> 00:06:34,130
Shock Wille!

77
00:06:49,478 --> 00:06:51,217
Mama! You're bleeding!

78
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:55,652
How dare you,
you damn runt!

79
00:06:55,739 --> 00:06:57,565
I'll make you more attractive!

80
00:06:57,565 --> 00:06:59,434
Assign!

81
00:07:06,435 --> 00:07:08,956
Huh? I'm stuck to Mama!

82
00:07:15,478 --> 00:07:20,043
What the hell is this?!
Did you just turn me into a magnet?!

83
00:07:20,478 --> 00:07:24,913
More, more...!
There's more where that came from!

84
00:07:38,435 --> 00:07:40,000
The towers' steel beams are gonna...

85
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:40,652
...collapse!

86
00:07:40,652 --> 00:07:41,782
Oh, crap!

87
00:07:43,608 --> 00:07:44,260
Uh?!

88
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:46,347
Release it, Trafalgar!

89
00:07:46,957 --> 00:07:48,391
Don't give me orders!

90
00:07:48,478 --> 00:07:51,782
Punk Clash!

91
00:08:25,608 --> 00:08:29,608
She was crushed
by those steel beams!

92
00:08:32,435 --> 00:08:34,782
She's gotta be dead...

93
00:08:35,696 --> 00:08:38,087
Not even Big Mom can...!

94
00:08:41,347 --> 00:08:43,999
There's my ace in the hole...

95
00:08:46,869 --> 00:08:50,912
How d'ya like that,
hag from hell?!

96
00:08:53,826 --> 00:08:56,652
So the awakened
Magnet-Magnet Fruit power...

97
00:08:58,565 --> 00:09:01,391
...lets you turn anything
into a magnet, huh.

98
00:09:04,565 --> 00:09:07,651
How long does it last?

99
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:13,174
Why the hell should I show you
what's in my hand?

100
00:09:41,869 --> 00:09:47,608
She's back on her feeeet!

101
00:09:52,086 --> 00:09:53,695
Life...

102
00:09:54,347 --> 00:09:56,564
...or...

103
00:09:56,565 --> 00:10:00,391
...oshiruko!

104
00:10:04,913 --> 00:10:09,086
Oh, no!
That's her Soul Pocus!

105
00:10:09,086 --> 00:10:11,564
"Life or oshiruko"?!

106
00:10:11,565 --> 00:10:14,521
We've got some oshiruko,
don't we?!

107
00:10:14,521 --> 00:10:17,304
Nope, we dumped it all...

108
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,826
If we don't got the soup,
she's gonna steal our lifespans!

109
00:10:56,826 --> 00:11:00,652
Get up, all of you!

110
00:11:00,652 --> 00:11:03,565
I give you life!

111
00:11:24,826 --> 00:11:29,434
I'm gonna use
a year's worth of my lifespan...

112
00:11:29,957 --> 00:11:35,174
There's no other way
to make myself stronger.

113
00:11:56,696 --> 00:11:58,174
She's getting bigger...

114
00:12:04,130 --> 00:12:07,739
Well, the bigger she is,
the better for us...

115
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:18,173
Gimme a break...

116
00:12:18,174 --> 00:12:23,260
Kick her ass or dice it,
it's gonna be a pain either way...

117
00:12:25,521 --> 00:12:29,999
How is this possible?!
She's gigantified!

118
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:33,957
That, and the castle's ablaze!
It doesn't get more dangerous than this!

119
00:12:33,957 --> 00:12:35,652
Aye...

120
00:12:35,652 --> 00:12:38,565
The Performance Floor's...

121
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,608
...a living hell!

122
00:12:45,478 --> 00:12:51,086
haven't felt this much pain...

123
00:12:51,086 --> 00:12:54,912
...in decades...!

124
00:12:55,608 --> 00:12:59,304
I'm impressed,

125
00:12:59,304 --> 00:13:01,651
Trafalgar Law...

126
00:13:02,260 --> 00:13:04,782
...and "Captain" Kid!

127
00:13:07,174 --> 00:13:11,043
Straw Hat Luffy, as well...

128
00:13:11,521 --> 00:13:18,608
I'm sure of it now,
you've all come for my throne!

129
00:13:26,957 --> 00:13:30,435
Can't believe I gotta
put down this monster...

130
00:13:30,435 --> 00:13:33,521
...just so I can
learn more about history!

131
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:38,261
Give it all ya got,
don't hold anything back!

132
00:13:38,304 --> 00:13:42,043
We're yankin' her off that throne,
even if it kills us!

133
00:13:42,043 --> 00:13:45,651
Then claim it, if you can!

134
00:13:45,696 --> 00:13:49,869
Prove you're worthy of
being an Emperor of the Sea!

135
00:13:55,435 --> 00:13:57,478
Ahead of me lies
nothing but soldiers!

136
00:13:57,478 --> 00:14:00,348
I must circumvent them
by way of the sacred cave!

137
00:14:05,826 --> 00:14:09,086
Whoa, wait a sec!
You lost it or something?!

138
00:14:09,086 --> 00:14:11,086
You don't got any reason to be slicing me!

139
00:14:11,086 --> 00:14:12,956
Arguing is pointless!

140
00:14:16,174 --> 00:14:18,260
Screw you, then!

141
00:14:18,347 --> 00:14:19,695
Scratch!

142
00:14:21,869 --> 00:14:23,391
Boom!

143
00:14:30,217 --> 00:14:33,043
I already figured out
how your attacks work!

144
00:14:35,521 --> 00:14:37,608
They're not going to work on me.

145
00:14:37,608 --> 00:14:39,347
You're bluffing!

146
00:14:39,347 --> 00:14:41,217
Your lines of attack...

147
00:14:41,608 --> 00:14:43,173
...are hard to see,

148
00:14:43,174 --> 00:14:45,304
but they are there!

149
00:14:45,304 --> 00:14:47,260
Activation requires the target's hearing.

150
00:14:47,260 --> 00:14:49,260
And the scope is your eyes!

151
00:14:49,304 --> 00:14:51,869
Don't give it all away!

152
00:14:51,869 --> 00:14:54,434
Won't make any difference anyway!

153
00:14:54,435 --> 00:15:00,000
You're screwed,
'cause I've got three of the Numbers here!

154
00:15:01,043 --> 00:15:02,347
Doesn't matter!

155
00:15:02,782 --> 00:15:07,217
To fulfill my duty to Straw Hat,
I need to put you down!

156
00:15:16,608 --> 00:15:17,347
Huh?

157
00:15:17,739 --> 00:15:20,130
Drake! Apoo!

158
00:15:20,130 --> 00:15:22,739
What is one of the Flying Six
and an informant doing here?

159
00:15:22,739 --> 00:15:27,913
I oughta be asking you that, Young Master!
What're you doing here?

160
00:15:35,043 --> 00:15:38,086
I thought you were
fighting against Kaido...

161
00:15:38,086 --> 00:15:39,999
I need to reach the armory!

162
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,608
Yamato...

163
00:15:41,608 --> 00:15:44,391
Yamato!
He's one of Kaido's enemies!

164
00:15:45,391 --> 00:15:48,739
Drake, that idiot...
He's useless anyway!

165
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:52,347
How about we swap, then?

166
00:15:52,347 --> 00:15:53,521
Drake, let me...

167
00:15:53,521 --> 00:15:57,043
Wait a sec, wait a sec,
Young Master Yamato!

168
00:15:57,435 --> 00:16:00,391
Have I got some good news for you!

169
00:16:01,217 --> 00:16:04,391
Whatever it is,
I do not have time for!

170
00:16:04,957 --> 00:16:07,652
I have severed ties with Kaido!

171
00:16:07,652 --> 00:16:09,608
Do not think of me as your ally!

172
00:16:09,608 --> 00:16:12,565
Seriously?!
Then we really gotta talk!

173
00:16:12,565 --> 00:16:16,608
At any rate, I haven't the time
to chat with you lot!

174
00:16:16,608 --> 00:16:19,651
Make way, Animal Kingdom Pirates!

175
00:16:19,652 --> 00:16:20,913
You will not bar my path!

176
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,739
Wait, Yamato! I...

177
00:16:23,086 --> 00:16:26,086
If you will not move...
I shall make you!

178
00:16:26,869 --> 00:16:27,912
Wait, dammit!

179
00:16:27,913 --> 00:16:30,913
Do not even think you can stop me!

180
00:16:35,260 --> 00:16:37,217
Make way at once!

181
00:16:37,217 --> 00:16:39,608
I've broken off from
the Animal Kingdom Pirates!

182
00:16:39,608 --> 00:16:42,434
I don't have anything
to do with Kaido, either!

183
00:16:42,478 --> 00:16:44,000
Eh?! Really, now?!

184
00:16:44,347 --> 00:16:46,869
Apologies, Drake...
But I must hurry!

185
00:16:58,217 --> 00:17:00,652
Off I go...
Until then!

186
00:17:01,130 --> 00:17:03,956
Onigashima and
the Flower Capital are in danger!

187
00:17:03,957 --> 00:17:04,739
Hey!

188
00:17:06,347 --> 00:17:09,347
Dammit! Every last one of 'em...

189
00:17:09,347 --> 00:17:11,695
None of 'em are followin' my beat!

190
00:17:12,304 --> 00:17:15,390
I gotta Yamato on my side somehow!

191
00:17:19,478 --> 00:17:21,087
Where are you going, Fuga?!

192
00:17:25,435 --> 00:17:26,521
V
What the...?!

193
00:17:31,869 --> 00:17:32,565
Eh?!

194
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,522
Fuga!

195
00:17:36,217 --> 00:17:36,956
See you later!

196
00:17:39,739 --> 00:17:41,130
Hey, Fuga....

197
00:17:46,086 --> 00:17:47,782
Whaaaa?!

198
00:17:48,217 --> 00:17:49,913
Where ya going, Fuga?!

199
00:17:49,913 --> 00:17:52,043
Stop!

200
00:17:52,043 --> 00:17:54,695
What the hell is going on?!

201
00:17:54,739 --> 00:17:55,522
Hey!

202
00:17:56,347 --> 00:18:00,347
Let's stop them!
Follow me, guys!

203
00:18:04,869 --> 00:18:06,782
I won't let you get away,

204
00:18:06,826 --> 00:18:10,521
Young Master Yamato!

205
00:18:12,174 --> 00:18:14,652
I won't let you get away, Apoo!

206
00:18:23,913 --> 00:18:26,478
Run, Baron Corpse!

207
00:18:26,478 --> 00:18:27,695
Why, though?

208
00:18:27,696 --> 00:18:30,086
Protect Nico Robin!

209
00:18:30,086 --> 00:18:32,912
We'd rather you leave them to us.

210
00:18:39,608 --> 00:18:41,173
Minks!

211
00:18:41,217 --> 00:18:43,304
Go, Baron Corpse!

212
00:18:44,478 --> 00:18:45,521
Robin-san!

213
00:18:46,913 --> 00:18:48,478
Let's be off!

214
00:18:48,913 --> 00:18:50,348
Brook!

215
00:18:52,652 --> 00:18:57,261
We shan't let their
sacrifice be in vain!

216
00:19:15,565 --> 00:19:19,304
For them to defeat
the Minks so handily...

217
00:19:19,304 --> 00:19:22,043
Who are they, truly?

218
00:19:22,043 --> 00:19:27,390
They're a Cipher Pol unit, CP-0.
They were at Dress Rosa...

219
00:19:27,478 --> 00:19:32,304
Cipher PolThe intelligence bureau
working directly for the Government, right?!

220
00:19:32,739 --> 00:19:35,739
Why are they here
on Onigashima, though?

221
00:19:35,739 --> 00:19:36,826
I don't know...

222
00:19:37,217 --> 00:19:41,130
All I know is, the situation
can't possibly get any worse.

223
00:19:41,217 --> 00:19:41,826
Eh?

224
00:19:42,782 --> 00:19:46,434
Of all the elements of CP-0,
the top-ranking unit in Cipher Pol,

225
00:19:47,304 --> 00:19:51,043
the masked agents are exceptions
among the exceptional.

226
00:19:53,957 --> 00:19:56,609
If you'll allow me, Robin-san...

227
00:19:57,174 --> 00:19:58,695
Up and away!

228
00:20:07,086 --> 00:20:08,260
What should I do?

229
00:20:08,260 --> 00:20:10,086
Chuji!

230
00:20:11,391 --> 00:20:14,521
Where did you go, Chuji?

231
00:20:21,652 --> 00:20:24,043
E-Excuse me! I...

232
00:20:24,043 --> 00:20:26,434
Please, you must help me!

233
00:20:26,869 --> 00:20:28,999
Judge once said...

234
00:20:29,521 --> 00:20:32,912
I am just a geisha,
brought in from the Flower Capital!

235
00:20:33,347 --> 00:20:35,651
With the power of science...

236
00:20:35,696 --> 00:20:36,391
Shut up...

237
00:20:36,739 --> 00:20:41,782
he'd create a warrior
with an unfeeling heart of ice!

238
00:20:42,304 --> 00:20:43,043
Shut up!

239
00:20:43,347 --> 00:20:45,738
I'm begging you! Please let me go!

240
00:20:45,739 --> 00:20:50,087
That Germa blood you've got in ya has gotta
be goin' crazy right now, right?!

241
00:20:50,435 --> 00:20:52,304
Shut up! I'm...

242
00:20:53,478 --> 00:20:55,261
...human, dammit!

243
00:21:09,696 --> 00:21:10,782
You okay, m'lady?

244
00:21:10,869 --> 00:21:11,999
Stay away from me!

245
00:21:13,739 --> 00:21:15,130
Stay away...!

246
00:21:26,869 --> 00:21:27,999
Help me!

247
00:21:30,565 --> 00:21:32,999
O-Some, what happened?!

248
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:35,478
You're bleeding!
Who would do such a thing?!

249
00:21:37,130 --> 00:21:39,217
Are you okay? Let me help!

250
00:21:41,565 --> 00:21:45,260
How could you do this
to such a young girl?!

251
00:21:45,913 --> 00:21:48,391
Wait, please!
There's been a misunderstanding!

252
00:21:48,391 --> 00:21:49,130
Not another word!

253
00:21:49,130 --> 00:21:51,739
You're one of
Wano's soldiers, are you not?

254
00:21:51,739 --> 00:21:52,913
That's right...

255
00:21:53,260 --> 00:21:55,651
How dare you do this to your own?!

256
00:21:55,652 --> 00:21:58,956
I didn't, though!
Please, just listen to me!

257
00:21:58,957 --> 00:22:00,478
I'm pretty sure I...

258
00:22:02,478 --> 00:22:05,521
I didn't do anything...

259
00:22:07,826 --> 00:22:09,217
Didn't do anything...

260
00:22:10,043 --> 00:22:10,956
...to her...

261
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:13,348
I think...

262
